# AGENTS.md is committed as a symlink to CLAUDE.md, so Codex and Claude Code read
# the same file. .agents/ is the bundle's generated Codex mirror of .claude/ — a
# blind .claude -> .Codex path substitution whose every rules path is dangling.
# Ignored so a regenerated copy cannot be committed alongside the real rules.
.agents/
